text: ['({T}: Add {G}.)', '({T}: Add {R}.)', 'As an additional cost to cast this spell, reveal an Elf card from your hand or pay {3}.\\nDeathtouch (Any amount of damage this deals to a creature is enough to destroy it.)', 'Create a 1/1 green Elf Warrior creature token for each Elf you control.', 'Cycling {1}{R} ({1}{R}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)\\nWhen you cycle Gempalm Incinerator, you may have it deal X damage to target creature, where X is the number of Goblins on the battlefield.', 'Cycling {2}{G}{G} ({2}{G}{G}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)\\nWhen you cycle Gempalm Strider, Elf creatures get +2/+2 until end of turn.', 'Draw three cards.', 'Echo {1}{R} (At the beginning of your upkeep, if this came under your control since the beginning of your last upkeep, sacrifice it unless you pay its echo cost.)\\nWhen Mogg War Marshal enters the battlefield or dies, create a 1/1 red Goblin creature token.', 'First strike\\n{R}, {T}: Attacking creatures gain first strike until end of turn.', 'Forests you control are 1/1 green Elf creatures that are still lands.\\n{1}{G}, Sacrifice an Elf: Target creature gets +3/+3 until end of turn.', 'Forgotten Cave enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {R}.\\nCycling {R} ({R}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', "Goblin Cohort can't attack unless you've cast a creature spell this turn.", 'Goblin spells you cast cost {1} less to cast.\\nGoblins you control have haste.', 'Haste (This creature can attack and {T} as soon as it comes under your control.)', 'Haste (This creature can attack and {T} as soon as it comes under your control.)\\nWhen Goblin Ringleader enters the battlefield, reveal the top four cards of your library. Put all Goblin cards revealed this way into your hand and the rest on the bottom of your library in any order.', "Haste\\nReckless One's power and toughness are each equal to the number of Goblins on the battlefield.", 'Haste\\nSacrifice a Goblin: Clickslither gets +2/+2 and gains trample until end of turn.', 'Other Elves you control get +1/+1.\\n{G}, {T}: Create a 1/1 green Elf Warrior creature token.', 'Protection from red\\nTap five untapped Goblins you control: Skirk Fire Marshal deals 10 damage to each creature and each player.', "Return an Elf you control to its owner's hand: Untap target creature. Activate only once each turn.", 'Sacrifice Elvish Eulogist: You gain 1 life for each Elf card in your graveyard.', 'Sacrifice Emberwilde Augur: It deals 3 damage to target player or planeswalker. Activate only during your upkeep.', 'Sacrifice Mogg Fanatic: It deals 1 damage to any target.', 'Sacrifice Moonglove Extract: It deals 2 damage to any target.', 'Sacrifice a Goblin: Add {R}.', 'Sacrifice a Goblin: Target creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', "Skirk Shaman can't be blocked except by artifact creatures and/or red creatures.", 'Spitting Earth deals damage to target creature equal to the number of Mountains you control.', 'Tap five untapped Elves you control: Create a 7/7 green Elemental creature token with trample.', 'Tarfire deals 2 damage to any target.', 'Target creature gets +2/+2 and gains trample until end of turn.\\nDraw a card.', 'Target creature gets +3/+3 until end of turn.', "Trample (This creature can deal excess combat damage to the player or planeswalker it's attacking.)\\nWhen Sylvan Messenger enters the battlefield, reveal the top four cards of your library. Put all Elf cards revealed this way into your hand and the rest on the bottom of your library in any order.", "Trample\\nHeedless One's power and toughness are each equal to the number of Elves on the battlefield.", 'Tranquil Thicket enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {G}.\\nCycling {G} ({G}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'When Elvish Harbinger enters the battlefield, you may search your library for an Elf card, reveal it, then shuffle and put that card on top.\\n{T}: Add one mana of any color.', 'When Goblin Matron enters the battlefield, you may search your library for a Goblin card, reveal that card, put it into your hand, then shuffle.', 'When Mudbutton Torchrunner dies, it deals 3 damage to any target.', 'When Siege-Gang Commander enters the battlefield, create three 1/1 red Goblin creature tokens.\\n{1}{R}, Sacrifice a Goblin: Siege-Gang Commander deals 2 damage to any target.', 'When Wirewood Herald dies, you may search your library for an Elf card, reveal that card, put it into your hand, then shuffle.', 'When Wood Elves enters the battlefield, search your library for a Forest card, put that card onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', "Whenever Skirk Drill Sergeant or another Goblin dies, you may pay {2}{R}. If you do, reveal the top card of your library. If it's a Goblin permanent card, put it onto the battlefield. Otherwise, put it into your graveyard.", 'Whenever another Goblin you control becomes blocked, sacrifice it. If you do, it deals 4 damage to each creature blocking it.\\nSacrifice two Mountains: Create two 1/1 red Goblin creature tokens.', 'Whenever another Goblin you control is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, you may have Boggart Shenanigans deal 1 damage to target player or planeswalker.', 'Whenever you cast an Elf spell, you may create a 1/1 green Elf Warrior creature token.', "You may exile two green cards from your hand rather than pay this spell's mana cost.\\nAllosaurus Rider's power and toughness are each equal to 1 plus the number of lands you control.", '{4}, {T}, Discard your hand: Draw a card for each creature you control.', '{7}{G}: Stonewood Invoker gets +5/+5 until end of turn.', '{7}{R}: Flamewave Invoker deals 5 damage to target player or planeswalker.', '{T}, Sacrifice a Goblin: Tar Pitcher deals 2 damage to any target.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{1}{R}, {T}: Target Goblin creature gets +2/+0 until end of turn.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{G}, {T}: Untap target Elf.', '{T}: Add {G}.', '{T}: Target creature gets +X/+X until end of turn, where X is the number of Elves on the battlefield.', '{T}: You gain 1 life for each Elf on the battlefield.']
flavor: ['"After Auntie brushed the soot from her eyes, she discovered something wonderful: the fire had turned the goat into something that smelled delicious."\\n—A tale of Auntie Grub', '"Auntie Grub had caught a goat, a bleating doe that still squirmed in her arms. At the same time, her warren decided to share with her a sensory greeting of hot tar . . . ."\\n—A tale of Auntie Grub', '"Channel your vitality through me."', '"Close your ears to the voice of greed, and you can turn a gift for one into a gift for many."', '"Everybody but me—CHARGE!"', '"I got it! I got it! I—"', '"I like goblins. They make funny little popping sounds when they die."\\n—Braids, dementia summoner', '"I order you to volunteer."', '"Let\'s play \'sled.\' Here\'s how it works: you\'re the sled."', '"Life\'s greatest lessons don\'t come from focus or concentration. They come from breathing and simply noticing."\\n—Seton, centaur druid', '"My tales of war are the stories most asked for around the fires at night, but they\'re the ones I care least to tell."', '"No matter how adept our artistic skill, our effigies can never hope to capture the vibrant beauty of a living elf. Perhaps that is truly why we mourn."', '"Release chaos with me!"', '"Within each of you is the strength of a landslide."\\n—Kumano, to his pupils', 'Akki shells provided good protection when downhill charging became headlong tumbling.', 'Boggarts revel in discovering new sensations, from the texture of an otter pellet to the squeak of a dying warren mate.', 'Diluted, moonglove can etch living tissue. Concentrated, a drop will kill a giant.', "Even through the Mirari's voice, the elves still hear the call of their kinship.", 'Every branch a crossroads, every vine a swift steed.', "From the highest tiers of Dawn's Light Palace to the deepest shade of Wren's Run, the silver notes of the horn shimmer through the air, and all who hear it feel its pull.", 'He raged at the world, at his family, at his life. But mostly he just raged.', "He's boss because he's smart enough to get out of the way.", 'In a culture of beauty, the most beautiful are worshipped as gods.', "In a shaman's grimy hands, a concoction of dried Skirk Ridge herbs can become the face of panic.", 'Inside even the humblest goblin lurks the potential for far greater things—and far worse.', 'It drinks fatigue.', 'Legends say a djinn gave the goblins a gift they could never hope to master.', 'No matter where you find them, goblins love rocks.', 'One bone broken for every twig snapped underfoot.\\n—Llanowar penalty for trespassing', 'The Mirari pulses in his veins.', 'The faultless and immaculate castes form the lower tiers of elvish society, with the exquisite caste above them. At the pinnacle is the perfect, a consummate blend of aristocrat and predator.', 'The goblins laughed as the elf ran away, until more came back.', 'The least popular goblins get the outer caves.', 'The oil sloshes against his skull as he nears his destination: the Frogtosser Games and the lighting of the Flaming Boggart.', 'The pattern of life can be studied like a book, if you know how to read it.', "The ritual of making draws upon the elves' memories and pasts. And elves have long memories and ancient pasts.", "There's always room for one more.", 'They poured from the Skirk Ridge like lava, burning and devouring everything in their path.', 'Two times the size, four times the smell.']
artist: ['Alex Horley-Orlandelli', 'Anthony S. Waters', 'Ben Thompson', 'Brandon Kitkouski', 'Brom', 'Chippy', 'Christopher Moeller', 'Christopher Rush', 'Corey D. Macourek', 'Daniel Gelon', 'Daren Bader', 'Darrell Riche', 'Dave Dorman', 'David Day', 'David Martin', 'Doug Chaffee', 'Eric Peterson', 'Glen Angus', 'Greg Hildebrandt & Tim Hildebrandt', 'Heather Hudson', 'Jeff Miracola', 'Jim Murray', 'John Avon', 'Kev Walker', 'Larry MacDougall', 'Luca Zontini', 'Lucio Parrillo', 'Mark Romanoski', 'Mark Zug', 'Matt Cavotta', 'Michael Koelsch', 'Nottsuo', 'Omar Rayyan', 'Paolo Parente', 'Pete Venters', 'Rob Alexander', 'Ron Spencer', 'Sam Wood', 'Scott M. Fischer', 'Steve Ellis', 'Terese Nielsen', 'Thomas M. Baxa', 'Tim Hildebrandt', 'Tony Szczudlo', 'Warren Mahy', 'Wayne England', 'Wayne Reynolds']
