'WC99', 'WHO', 'WOE', 'XANA', 'XLN', 'ZEN', 'ZNC', 'ZNR']
original_text: ["As an additional cost to play Wren's Run Vanquisher, reveal an Elf card from your hand or pay {3}.\\nDeathtouch (Whenever this creature deals damage to a creature, destroy that creature.)", 'Cycling {1}{R} ({1}{R}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)\\nWhen you cycle Gempalm Incinerator, you may have it deal X damage to target creature, where X is the number of Goblins in play.', 'Cycling {2}{G}{G} ({2}{G}{G}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)\\nWhen you cycle Gempalm Strider, all Elf creatures get +2/+2 until end of turn.', 'Draw three cards.', 'Echo {1}{R} (At the beginning of your upkeep, if this came under your control since the beginning of your last upkeep, sacrifice it unless you pay its echo cost.)\\nWhen Mogg War Marshal comes into play or is put into a graveyard from play, put a 1/1 red Goblin creature token into play.', 'First strike\\n{R}, {T}: Attacking creatures gain first strike until end of turn.', 'Forests you control are 1/1 green Elf creatures that are still lands.\\n{1}{G}, Sacrifice an Elf: Target creature gets +3/+3 until end of turn.', 'Forgotten Cave comes into play tapped.\\n{T}: Add {R} to your mana pool.\\nCycling {R} ({R}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', "Goblin Cohort can't attack unless you've played a creature spell this turn.", 'Goblin spells you play cost {1} less to play.\\nGoblin creatures you control have haste.', 'Haste', "Haste\\nReckless One's power and toughness are each equal to the number of Goblins in play.", 'Haste\\nSacrifice a Goblin: Clickslither gets +2/+2 and gains trample until end of turn.', 'Haste\\nWhen Goblin Ringleader comes into play, reveal the top four cards of your library. Put all Goblin cards revealed this way into your hand and the rest on the bottom of your library.', 'Other Elf creatures you control get +1/+1.\\n{G}, {T}: Put a 1/1 green Elf Warrior creature token into play.', 'Protection from red\\nTap five untapped Goblins you control: Skirk Fire Marshal deals 10 damage to each creature and each player.', 'Put a 1/1 green Elf Warrior creature token into play for each Elf you control.', "Return an Elf you control to its owner's hand: Untap target creature. Play this ability only once each turn.", 'Sacrifice Elvish Eulogist: You gain 1 life for each Elf card in your graveyard.', 'Sacrifice Emberwilde Augur: Emberwilde Augur deals 3 damage to target player. Play this ability only during your upkeep.', 'Sacrifice Mogg Fanatic: Mogg Fanatic deals 1 damage to target creature or player.', 'Sacrifice Moonglove Extract: Moonglove Extract deals 2 damage to target creature or player.', 'Sacrifice a Goblin: Add {R} to your mana pool.', 'Sacrifice a Goblin: Target creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', "Skirk Shaman can't be blocked except by artifact creatures and/or red creatures.", 'Spitting Earth deals damage equal to the number of Mountains you control to target creature.', 'Tap five untapped Elves you control: Put a 7/7 green Elemental creature token with trample into play.', 'Tarfire deals 2 damage to target creature or player.', 'Target creature gets +2/+2 and gains trample until end of turn.\\nDraw a card.', 'Target creature gets +3/+3 until end of turn.', "Trample\\nHeedless One's power and toughness are each equal to the number of Elves in play.", 'Trample\\nWhen Sylvan Messenger comes into play, reveal the top four cards of your library. Put all Elf cards revealed this way into your hand and the rest on the bottom of your library.', 'Tranquil Thicket comes into play tapped.\\n{T}: Add {G} to your mana pool.\\nCycling {G} ({G}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'When Elvish Harbinger comes into play, you may search your library for an Elf card, reveal it, then shuffle your library and put that card on top of it.\\n{T}: Add one mana of any color to your mana pool.', 'When Goblin Matron comes into play, you may search your library for a Goblin card, reveal that card, and put it into your hand. If you do, shuffle your library.', 'When Mudbutton Torchrunner is put into a graveyard from play, it deals 3 damage to target creature or player.', 'When Siege-Gang Commander comes into play, put three 1/1 red Goblin creature tokens into play.\\n{1}{R}, Sacrifice a Goblin: Siege-Gang Commander deals 2 damage to target creature or player.', 'When Wirewood Herald is put into a graveyard from play, you may search your library for an Elf card. If you do, reveal that card and put it into your hand. Then shuffle your library.', 'When Wood Elves comes into play, search your library for a Forest card and put that card into play. Then shuffle your library.', "Whenever Skirk Drill Sergeant or another Goblin is put into a graveyard from play, you may pay {2}{R}. If you do, reveal the top card of your library. If it's a Goblin permanent card, put it into play. Otherwise, put it into your graveyard.", 'Whenever another Goblin you control becomes blocked, sacrifice it. If you do, it deals 4 damage to each creature blocking it.\\nSacrifice two Mountains: Put two 1/1 red Goblin creature tokens into play.', 'Whenever another Goblin you control is put into a graveyard from play, you may have Boggart Shenanigans deal 1 damage to target player.', 'Whenever you play an Elf spell, you may put a 1/1 green Elf Warrior creature token into play.', "You may remove two green cards in your hand from the game rather than pay Allosaurus Rider's mana cost.\\nAllosaurus Rider's power and toughness are each equal to 1 plus the number of lands you control.", '{4}, {T}, Discard your hand: Draw a card for each creature you control.', '{7}{G}: Stonewood Invoker gets +5/+5 until end of turn.', '{7}{R}: Flamewave Invoker deals 5 damage to target player.', '{T}, Sacrifice a Goblin: Tar Pitcher deals 2 damage to target creature or player.', '{T}: Add {1} to your mana pool.\\n{1}{R}, {T}: Target Goblin creature gets +2/+0 until end of turn.', '{T}: Add {1} to your mana pool.\\n{G}, {T}: Untap target Elf.', '{T}: Add {G} to your mana pool.', '{T}: Target creature gets +X/+X until end of turn, where X is the number of Elves in play.', '{T}: You gain 1 life for each Elf in play.']
original_type: ['Artifact', 'Basic Land - Forest', 'Basic Land - Mountain', 'Creature - Elf', 'Creature - Elf Avatar', 'Creature - Elf Druid', 'Creature - Elf Mutant', 'Creature - Elf Scout', 'Creature - Elf Shaman', 'Creature - Elf Warrior', 'Creature - Goblin', 'Creature - Goblin Avatar', 'Creature - Goblin Berserker', 'Creature - Goblin Mutant', 'Creature - Goblin Shaman', 'Creature - Goblin Warrior', 'Creature - Insect', 'Instant', 'Land', 'Legendary Creature - Goblin Advisor', 'Sorcery', 'Tribal Enchantment - Goblin', 'Tribal Instant - Goblin', 'Tribal Sorcery - Elf']
